Creates a temporal echo in a radius of [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] around you.  Affected targets take [134, 180, 216, 246, 273 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage, as well as up to [17%, 25%, 30%, 33%, 36% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] of the difference between their current life and max life as additional temporal damage.

The additional damage will be divided by the target's rank and the damage scales with your Spellpower.
